<title>FRANCE: French production bottlenecks still low - survey.</title>
<headline>French production bottlenecks still low - survey.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Although French production bottlenecks are slightly higher, the proportion of companies facing bottlenecks has remained at a low level for more than a year, INSEE said in its quarterly survey of business leaders.</p>
<p>INSEE gave the following data on percentages of companies reporting production bottlenecks:</p>
<p>				97  97  96  96  96  96   95</p>
<p>			     Apr  Jan Oct Jul Apr Jan Oct</p>
<p> Industry overall	 12  11  16  14  15  13   19</p>
<p> Manufacturing	    13  10  12  12  11  13   17</p>
<p>It gave the following data on capacity utilisation rates (in percentages) broken down by sector:</p>
<p>			    97   97     96   96   96    96   95</p>
<p>			   Apr   Jan    Oct  Jul  Apr   Jan  Oct</p>
<p> Industry overall     81.1 81.4   82.3 82.7 83.8  83.6 84.2</p>
<p> Manufacturing	  82.7 82.7   82.1 82.4 83.6  83.5 84.2</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5071</p>
